    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "The https://github.com/rapidsai/cudf/issues/15258 issue is a compute-sanitizer error where it incorrectly reports a misaligned read with int16 data types. It appears to be fixed in 12.5 now. If you are not seeing the misaligned error outside of compute-sanitizer then this is likely an issue with compute-sanitizer since a misaligned error would normally throw a runtime exception.",
